was because I had gotten
into a dangerous situation

00:31:18.670 --> 00:31:22.020
with some people that
I shouldn't have been

00:31:22.020 --> 00:31:26.940
hanging out with and I'm
not gonna go too into detail

00:31:26.940 --> 00:31:29.017
about that but just
because it's not something

00:31:29.017 --> 00:31:32.200
that needs to be talked about.

00:31:32.200 --> 00:31:36.700
But so my mom thought me being in jail

00:31:36.700 --> 00:31:38.873
they were protecting,
she was protecting me.

00:31:39.894 --> 00:31:43.027
People had like, hacked into
my phone and things like that

00:31:43.027 --> 00:31:47.190
and were watching me and stuff like that.

00:31:47.190 --> 00:31:48.820
So it was kind of, it was scary.

00:31:48.820 --> 00:31:50.960
So she left me in there for that reason.

00:31:50.960 --> 00:31:52.670
And also because I needed to sober up

00:31:52.670 --> 00:31:54.800
and that was when I started withdrawing.

00:31:54.800 --> 00:31:57.540
And I was like, Oh my God, like in jail,

00:31:57.540 --> 00:32:00.100
they don't care about
you unless you're dying.

00:32:00.100 --> 00:32:02.780
Then they'll probably, maybe
give you an ibuprofen, maybe.

00:32:02.780 --> 00:32:05.674
But after that I got out of jail

00:32:05.674 --> 00:32:08.840
and I was like, I signed for probation.

00:32:08.840 --> 00:32:11.257
I I could do time served or probation

00:32:11.257 --> 00:32:13.690
but at 19 I didn't want to be a felon.

00:32:13.690 --> 00:32:15.070
So I signed for probation

00:32:15.070 --> 00:32:18.613
and not even a month after
being in jail, I got pregnant.

00:32:19.476 --> 00:32:24.450
I didn't know I was pregnant
until four months afterwards.

00:32:24.450 --> 00:32:26.790
By then I had already
started doing heroin again.

00:32:26.790 --> 00:32:29.490
I did heroin three hours
after I got out of jail.

00:32:29.490 --> 00:32:30.323
Only three.

00:32:31.297 --> 00:32:34.560
And I started abusing heroin
hard and cocaine hard.

00:32:34.560 --> 00:32:35.880
Again and again.

00:32:35.880 --> 00:32:38.490
And by the time I found
out I was pregnant,

00:32:38.490 --> 00:32:40.734
I was already physically dependent.

00:32:40.734 --> 00:32:45.630
The doctors told me that
if I stopped immediately

00:32:45.630 --> 00:32:49.018
there's a chance that my
baby's not gonna make it.

00:32:49.018 --> 00:32:51.290
And I always thought I was
going to have an abortion.

00:32:51.290 --> 00:32:53.020
I swore up and down,
If I ever get pregnant

00:32:53.020 --> 00:32:54.970
it's abort mission, no matter what.

00:32:54.970 --> 00:32:59.490
But when I saw him, he was in there,

00:32:59.490 --> 00:33:01.220
he was moving around and looked like that

00:33:01.220 --> 00:33:03.010
with their little arms
and I heard his heartbeat.

00:33:03.010 --> 00:33:03.860
I couldn't do it.

00:33:09.587 --> 00:33:12.053
And my son today is 11 months

00:33:14.700 --> 00:33:19.293
and he is the best thing
that has ever happened to me.

00:33:24.480 --> 00:33:27.840
I ended up signing for the felony

00:33:27.840 --> 00:33:29.350
cause I went to jail four more times

00:33:29.350 --> 00:33:30.650
for a probation violation.

00:33:31.523 --> 00:33:32.603
But I got into rehab.

00:33:33.440 --> 00:33:35.530
When I finally found help
I got put on methadone

00:33:35.530 --> 00:33:37.560
because I didn't want to lose him.

00:33:37.560 --> 00:33:39.260
And a lot of people talk shit on me

00:33:39.260 --> 00:33:41.330
because I got on that medication.

00:33:41.330 --> 00:33:44.590
And when he was born he
was addicted to methadone

00:33:44.590 --> 00:33:45.640
and they had a wean him.

00:33:45.640 --> 00:33:49.850
I got a lot of disrespect for it

00:33:53.541 --> 00:33:55.713
but my son was born not breathing.

00:34:01.725 --> 00:34:04.350
So I thought, I felt something was wrong

00:34:04.350 --> 00:34:05.520
in the operation room later.

00:34:05.520 --> 00:34:07.970
They gave me a C-section
cause he just got stuck.

00:34:09.260 --> 00:34:13.670
And I knew, I felt death,
but I thought it was me.

00:34:13.670 --> 00:34:17.370
I thought I was dying
and I was okay with dying

00:34:17.370 --> 00:34:20.423
because I knew my son was going
to be okay with my parents.

00:34:26.940 --> 00:34:30.220
When I finally got to see
him he was covered with tubes

00:34:30.220 --> 00:34:33.640
and couldn't touch him because
he would, he was scared.

00:34:33.640 --> 00:34:35.300
They had to bring him back.

00:34:35.300 --> 00:34:36.873
He was like shocked.

00:34:39.080 --> 00:34:41.647
And I remember spending every single day

00:34:41.647 --> 00:34:44.940
at all hours of the day in that NICU.

00:34:44.940 --> 00:34:46.933
I slept there in the waiting room.

00:34:50.063 --> 00:34:52.663
And it was the hardest thing
I've ever had to watch.

00:34:53.880 --> 00:34:56.400
And I promised myself, I would never,

00:34:56.400 --> 00:34:58.673
ever, ever touch heroin again.

00:35:03.780 --> 00:35:05.960
Cause my son didn't deserve that.

00:35:05.960 --> 00:35:07.133
He didn't ask for that.

00:35:08.810 --> 00:35:12.010
I was so scared because I told my mom,

00:35:12.010 --> 00:35:14.290
I'm not gonna be able to do this, mom.

00:35:14.290 --> 00:35:17.118
I'm not, I can't raise him.

00:35:17.118 --> 00:35:19.690
I can't can't take care of me.

00:35:19.690 --> 00:35:21.363
Can't even take care of myself.

00:35:25.930 --> 00:35:27.727
And I tried so hard

00:35:32.815 --> 00:35:34.040
and I ended up relapsing

00:35:35.610 --> 00:35:38.470
two months later in March.

00:35:38.470 --> 00:35:39.730
I had six months clean.

00:35:39.730 --> 00:35:42.030
I never tried to get clean before.

00:35:42.030 --> 00:35:42.863
I was doing good.

00:35:42.863 --> 00:35:44.765
I got a new car.

00:35:44.765 --> 00:35:47.340
I had my son, my family trusted me

00:35:47.340 --> 00:35:49.610
to do what I wanted, when I wanted

00:35:49.610 --> 00:35:53.820
as long as I came back,
I went to an AA meetings.

00:35:53.820 --> 00:35:54.670
I did all that.

00:35:54.670 --> 00:35:57.600
And I really just took care of my son.

00:35:57.600 --> 00:36:00.113
And I really love being a mom.

00:36:01.470 --> 00:36:04.590
By then they were gonna take my son.

00:36:04.590 --> 00:36:06.910
They told them, they told my
mom, they had to take him.

00:36:06.910 --> 00:36:08.003
He had to be removed.

00:36:09.680 --> 00:36:12.650
And it was either me
be at my parents' house

00:36:12.650 --> 00:36:14.700
or my son be at my parents' house.

00:36:14.700 --> 00:36:15.613
So I left.

00:36:17.660 --> 00:36:21.263
I was dating a man, he was older than me.

00:36:21.263 --> 00:36:23.340
He's was 43 and he had money

00:36:23.340 --> 00:36:26.820
and I manipulated him into giving me

00:36:26.820 --> 00:36:31.820
a lot of money for drugs and
I had way too much drug money.

00:36:33.610 --> 00:36:36.100
I just went off the wall.

00:36:36.100 --> 00:36:38.493
I went on the run for a while,

00:36:39.770 --> 00:36:42.940
got picked up by bounty
hunters and things like that.

00:36:42.940 --> 00:36:45.000
So I got out of jail in August.

00:36:45.000 --> 00:36:47.150
I signed for the felony
and the misdemeanor

00:36:48.090 --> 00:36:50.143
and I got tired of using.

00:36:51.243 --> 00:36:53.663
I had been in a relationship, me and Sam,

00:36:55.348 --> 00:36:59.690
when we broke up, I broke
up with him for another guy.

00:36:59.690 --> 00:37:01.130
The guy I was dating was a heroin addict

00:37:01.130 --> 00:37:03.403
who also liked to shoot
up heroin and cocaine.

00:37:04.240 --> 00:37:05.900
I really, I really loved this guy.

00:37:05.900 --> 00:37:06.780
I still do.

00:37:06.780 --> 00:37:11.533
We broke up this past,
we broke up in October.

00:37:14.097 --> 00:37:18.417
But he he really changed a lot for me.

00:37:20.010 --> 00:37:21.940
My perspective on things.

00:37:21.940 --> 00:37:23.630
He was my best friend.

00:37:23.630 --> 00:37:27.160
I loved talking to him,
just being with him.

00:37:27.160 --> 00:37:30.843
We lived together and he
showed so much love for my son.

00:37:34.259 --> 00:37:35.840
And he wanted me to do better

00:37:35.840 --> 00:37:40.840
and I just kept doing drugs
and he kept telling me,

00:37:41.130 --> 00:37:43.383
you gotta stop, you gotta
stop, you gotta stop.

00:37:44.490 --> 00:37:46.803
Because he wanted me to get my son back.

00:37:49.324 --> 00:37:53.900
One day, we had gotten
in a really bad argument

00:37:53.900 --> 00:37:58.810
because it really isn't important,

00:37:58.810 --> 00:38:00.510
but he had started hitting me.

00:38:00.510 --> 00:38:01.390
Not really every day.

00:38:01.390 --> 00:38:03.741
Not like that, it was just like little,

00:38:03.741 --> 00:38:04.720
why are you doing that?

00:38:04.720 --> 00:38:05.950
Don't do that.

00:38:05.950 --> 00:38:08.830
But this time it was really heavy.

00:38:08.830 --> 00:38:11.450
He poured a Gatorade bottle on my head

00:38:12.610 --> 00:38:16.540
like called me all these
mean names and spit on me

00:38:16.540 --> 00:38:17.653
and tried to kick me.

00:38:18.810 --> 00:38:19.880
He wouldn't hit my face,

00:38:19.880 --> 00:38:22.405
but I was already trying to go down.

00:38:22.405 --> 00:38:25.185
I was just begging him to please stop.

00:38:25.185 --> 00:38:28.753
You can't hurt somebody like
this when you love them.

00:38:31.743 --> 00:38:33.620
And he went and he got his gun

00:38:34.809 --> 00:38:39.222
and I just remember begging,
please stop, I just prayed.

00:38:39.222 --> 00:38:43.335
Because I didn't know he
had done cocaine then.

00:38:43.335 --> 00:38:47.146
And when he does cocaine,
he is really angry.

00:38:47.146 --> 00:38:50.500
I just prayed to God.

00:38:50.500 --> 00:38:51.710
Please not today.

00:38:51.710 --> 00:38:53.443
I had my son's out there.

00:38:55.842 --> 00:38:57.523
But after that we broke up,

00:39:04.342 --> 00:39:07.259
I ended up moving in with his plug.

00:39:10.170 --> 00:39:12.000
Because he told me that
I was a nasty bitch

00:39:12.000 --> 00:39:14.630
and I told him I bet you're
plug doesn't think so.

00:39:14.630 --> 00:39:17.270
And I ended up moving in with his plug.

00:39:17.270 --> 00:39:18.670
He was really nice to me.

00:39:18.670 --> 00:39:21.280
They treated me like they
know me my whole life.

00:39:21.280 --> 00:39:22.370
They helped me out.

00:39:22.370 --> 00:39:24.470
He never once tried to sleep with me.

00:39:24.470 --> 00:39:25.695
I never slept with him.

00:39:25.695 --> 00:39:29.300
They took me out for my
birthday to a casino,

00:39:29.300 --> 00:39:31.000
they took me out to the club.

00:39:31.000 --> 00:39:32.600
I had a lot of fun there.

00:39:32.600 --> 00:39:35.440
But it was down the street
from my ex-boyfriend.

00:39:35.440 --> 00:39:38.373
So that was starting problems
and I wanted to get clean.

00:39:39.218 --> 00:39:42.336
So of course I called my ex,

00:39:42.336 --> 00:39:45.950
the one that the 43 year
old and he had ended up

00:39:45.950 --> 00:39:49.280
moving here to LA to get
away from me, he says.

00:39:49.280 --> 00:39:51.010
But I called him, asked
him to get me some help,

00:39:51.010 --> 00:39:53.420
if he could get me into
rehab, he said, yes.

00:39:53.420 --> 00:39:57.070
I get here and I don't
bring any heroin with me,

00:39:57.070 --> 00:39:59.410
no type of opiates, no
suboxone, no nothing.

00:39:59.410 --> 00:40:01.200
Cause I'm like ready to do it.

00:40:01.200 --> 00:40:04.050
And I got here and oh hell
no, I was not ready to do it.

00:40:04.050 --> 00:40:06.020
When I started kicking I was just like,

00:40:06.930 --> 00:40:08.020
nope, nope, nope, nope, nope.

00:40:08.020 --> 00:40:09.900
So I went out to find it

00:40:09.900 --> 00:40:12.330
and I knew, you know what,
maybe ask a homeless guy.

00:40:12.330 --> 00:40:13.163
He'll get it for me, right?

00:40:13.163 --> 00:40:14.127
He's gotta know.

00:40:14.127 --> 00:40:14.960
And he did.

00:40:14.960 --> 00:40:19.950
He got it for me and I was
doing that and I'm still living,

00:40:21.200 --> 00:40:23.000
I was living on Hollywood Boulevard.

00:40:24.118 --> 00:40:26.350
And the guy ended up kicking me out

00:40:26.350 --> 00:40:28.720
because he knew I was using drugs.

00:40:28.720 --> 00:40:31.431
And I was like, whatever,
I'll come over here.

00:40:31.431 --> 00:40:34.140
I had no idea what Skid Row was.

00:40:34.140 --> 00:40:36.010
I didn't know how bad it was

00:40:36.010 --> 00:40:39.680
and I ended up living
over here on seventh.

00:40:39.680 --> 00:40:42.870
And I just, I was like,
okay, well I'm homeless.

00:40:42.870 --> 00:40:44.010
It was okay.

00:40:44.010 --> 00:40:45.970
There's a bunch of other
homeless people, right?

00:40:45.970 --> 00:40:47.560
And I was like, he'll
take me back eventually.

00:40:47.560 --> 00:40:48.433
He still hasn't.

00:40:50.526 --> 00:40:52.410
It was just ridiculous.

00:40:52.410 --> 00:40:54.310
I didn't want a relationship with him

00:40:54.310 --> 00:40:55.900
and that's what he
thought it was gonna be.

00:40:55.900 --> 00:40:59.530
So being here has been really hard.

00:40:59.530 --> 00:41:02.150
I've only been on the
streets for three weeks

00:41:02.150 --> 00:41:07.150
and I ended up being kidnapped

00:41:08.300 --> 00:41:10.053
because the people I trusted,

00:41:11.430 --> 00:41:13.890
the guy, the person I was
living with in the tent,

00:41:13.890 --> 00:41:17.183
he let me stay there with
this girl that I liked.

00:41:20.761 --> 00:41:22.743
And he set me up.

00:41:23.710 --> 00:41:24.543
He got paid.

00:41:24.543 --> 00:41:27.960
I don't know how much, probably
not a lot, couple of bucks.

00:41:27.960 --> 00:41:31.240
And this man abducted me.

00:41:31.240 --> 00:41:33.950
Lied to me, he said, he
going, we're waiting,

00:41:33.950 --> 00:41:35.150
we're just gonna park.

00:41:35.150 --> 00:41:37.790
I sat down and he was
like "close the door".

00:41:37.790 --> 00:41:39.340
And I was like, "Oh, I'm good".

00:41:41.707 --> 00:41:43.313
And ended up just driving off.

00:41:44.190 --> 00:41:45.740
And I'm like, "wait, where are we going?

00:41:45.740 --> 00:41:46.687
What are we doing?"

00:41:46.687 --> 00:41:47.940
And he's like, "no, we're good,

00:41:47.940 --> 00:41:49.520
we're gonna stay in this neighborhood."

00:41:49.520 --> 00:41:52.460
We ended up, in the beginning it was cool,

00:41:52.460 --> 00:41:54.079
I had my stuff, he had his stuff.

00:41:54.079 --> 00:41:55.260
I was like, okay, cool,
we were just talking.

00:41:55.260 --> 00:41:56.093
It wasn't that bad.

00:41:56.093 --> 00:41:57.390
And I was like, "sorry
I was a bitch to you.

00:41:57.390 --> 00:41:58.700
I'm sorry.

00:41:58.700 --> 00:42:00.250
I don't trust people out here."

00:42:01.120 --> 00:42:02.720
Well, we ended up going to a hotel

00:42:02.720 --> 00:42:04.645
and he says he's gonna bring me back.

00:42:04.645 --> 00:42:06.480
Never brings me back.

00:42:06.480 --> 00:42:08.200
I have no idea where we are.

00:42:08.200 --> 00:42:09.610
There's no phone in the hotel room.

00:42:09.610 --> 00:42:10.523
There's no wifi.

00:42:13.850 --> 00:42:15.610
But you know, I told him in the beginning

00:42:15.610 --> 00:42:17.363
I'm not having sex with you.

00:42:17.363 --> 00:42:18.196
I'm not a prostitute.

00:42:18.196 --> 00:42:19.530
I don't do that kind of stuff.

00:42:19.530 --> 00:42:22.570
I don't have sex for money or drugs

00:42:22.570 --> 00:42:26.520
and he did not give a fuck about that.

00:42:28.830 --> 00:42:30.307
He tried to play that card.

00:42:30.307 --> 00:42:32.480
"I really liked you, I really liked you.

00:42:32.480 --> 00:42:35.027
I want to be with you, blah,
blah, blah, blah, blah."

00:42:36.260 --> 00:42:39.273
And he ended up taking advantage of me.

00:42:50.642 --> 00:42:51.963
And I was scared

00:42:51.963 --> 00:42:54.000
because nobody knew where I was

00:42:56.783 --> 00:42:57.616
out here on these streets.

00:42:57.616 --> 00:43:02.578
If I don't make it, what
if I just don't call?

00:43:02.578 --> 00:43:04.800
My mom doesn't know where I am.

00:43:04.800 --> 00:43:06.400
I only have one person out here

00:43:08.150 --> 00:43:10.500
who keeps in contact with my parents,

00:43:10.500 --> 00:43:13.560
not even really contact,
but my parents can call.

00:43:13.560 --> 00:43:15.470
Cause he lives in Hollywood.

00:43:15.470 --> 00:43:19.820
And I remember just thinking,
if something happens to me,

00:43:19.820 --> 00:43:22.022
my parents are never gonna know.

00:43:22.022 --> 00:43:23.110
My son's never gonna know what happened

00:43:23.110 --> 00:43:23.960
or where I am.

00:43:26.100 --> 00:43:27.453
I'm still on heroin.

00:43:28.640 --> 00:43:30.450
I've used a lot of meth lately.

00:43:30.450 --> 00:43:32.460
Cause there's not cocaine.

00:43:32.460 --> 00:43:35.100
I know there's cocaine out here somewhere.

00:43:35.100 --> 00:43:36.510
I just haven't found it.

00:43:36.510 --> 00:43:39.270
That is why I'm super, super skinny.

00:43:39.270 --> 00:43:41.420
And I have clamps on
the back of my shorts.

00:43:43.435 --> 00:43:44.930
- [Interviewer] What do you do for money?

00:43:44.930 --> 00:43:46.883
- For money, I do boosting.

00:43:47.760 --> 00:43:49.740
which is a thing that a
lot of people do out here.

00:43:49.740 --> 00:43:52.773
But really, if I'm
being completely honest,

00:43:54.073 --> 00:43:57.380
I really just have been
blessed in a lot of ways.

00:43:57.380 --> 00:44:00.200
So it's a lot of people who care for me

00:44:02.250 --> 00:44:05.590
who have helped provide me with shelter.

00:44:05.590 --> 00:44:07.563
That's made sure that I'm not sick.

00:44:10.760 --> 00:44:15.403
Who have made sure that I
eat and just watch for me.

00:44:16.792 --> 00:44:20.550
I don't think that everybody gets that

00:44:20.550 --> 00:44:24.383
because I've seen some girls
who are out here by themselves,

00:44:26.010 --> 00:44:28.730
I thank God every day for those things.

00:44:28.730 --> 00:44:31.570
Because every hard time that
I've gone through my life

00:44:31.570 --> 00:44:36.570
God has put someone in my path to help me.

00:44:36.670 --> 00:44:38.933
Whether it's the detox nurse in jail,

00:44:42.520 --> 00:44:47.373
somebody that is at the store
or another homeless person.

00:44:52.550 --> 00:44:57.550
So I think that all in
all, I wanna go home.

00:44:58.750 --> 00:45:02.222
But I'm not allowed to right
now because my son is there.

00:45:02.222 --> 00:45:06.680
As of today, I have contacted my mom,

00:45:06.680 --> 00:45:09.380
I've made plans to go home and go to rehab

00:45:10.480 --> 00:45:11.680
so that I can get my son

00:45:14.060 --> 00:45:17.530
because this is not for me.

00:45:17.530 --> 00:45:20.290
This is the place where people come

00:45:20.290 --> 00:45:23.742
and they get comfortable
living the way that they are

00:45:23.742 --> 00:45:25.690
because they have drugs, you know?

00:45:25.690 --> 00:45:28.000
And here it's easy to be homeless

00:45:28.000 --> 00:45:30.662
not easy, but you know,
it's more comfortable

00:45:30.662 --> 00:45:33.780
because there's a whole
bunch of other people.

00:45:33.780 --> 00:45:35.573
I want something for myself.

00:45:36.800 --> 00:45:39.423
I don't have again, my self
esteem right now sucks.

00:45:40.412 --> 00:45:43.260
I don't, I hate just every
bit of what I'm doing

00:45:43.260 --> 00:45:44.710
and what I've done.

00:45:44.710 --> 00:45:47.840
I don't want to be, I don't
want to be this person.

00:45:47.840 --> 00:45:49.573
I want to be a mom.

00:45:51.157 --> 00:45:52.595
I want to take care of my son.

00:45:52.595 --> 00:45:54.770
I want to be, I want to
make my parents proud.

00:45:54.770 --> 00:45:56.253
I want to make myself proud.

00:45:59.571 --> 00:46:01.360
So I'm not gonna stay here anymore.

00:46:01.360 --> 00:46:03.100
I'm not going to do it.

00:46:03.100 --> 00:46:05.490
And I know everybody
says that, but I'm not.

00:46:07.146 --> 00:46:08.310
I'm not going to be like everybody.

00:46:08.310 --> 00:46:10.590
I'm going to just, I'm gonna change.

00:46:10.590 --> 00:46:12.740
I don't want this life anymore.

00:46:12.740 --> 00:46:14.610
I don't want to be in and out of jail.

00:46:14.610 --> 00:46:16.560
I don't want to be on the streets

00:46:16.560 --> 00:46:18.900
because the streets, you
hear it all the time,

00:46:18.900 --> 00:46:19.900
the streets are dangerous,

00:46:19.900 --> 00:46:22.020
but when you actually live on them,

00:46:22.020 --> 00:46:23.573
it's a whole different story.

00:46:26.964 --> 00:46:28.586
So that's me.

00:46:28.586 --> 00:46:30.900
- [Interviewer] Good
luck with your recovery

00:46:30.900 --> 00:46:32.633
and getting back to your son.

